(7554616, 1210236, 173844, '<td valign="top">Unbelievably underappreciated, in my opinion.  The composition is wonderful, the texture sublime, the perspective exciting and the black and white rendering elegant.  The branches in the upper left are like a reclamation by time.  Just beautiful.  That''s your 9, sorry for not giving it a ten, and my favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Unbelievably underappreciated, in my opinion.  The composition is wonderful, the texture sublime, the perspective exciting and the black and white rendering elegant.  The branches in the upper left are like a reclamation by time.  Just beautiful.  That''s your 9, sorry for not giving it a ten, and my favorite of the challenge.', '2018-01-26 09:13:47.000000', NULL, 0),
